diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 8347b4a..bd4c89a 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,24 @@
 # deploy-demo
 
-Deploys the service to AWS on every push to `main`.
+Deploys the service to AWS on every push to `main` and on every pushed version tag matching `v*`.
+It can also be started manually with `workflow_dispatch`.
 
 This repository is public.
+
+## AWS authentication
+
+The workflow assumes `arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/deploy-widget` in `eu-north-1` through
+GitHub OIDC. No AWS access keys are stored; the `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` and
+`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` repository secrets are no longer used and should be deleted.
+
+The role's trust policy must accept the `sub` claim of each trigger, matched exactly:
+
+- `repo:<owner>/<repo>:ref:refs/heads/main` for pushes to `main`
+- `repo:<owner>/<repo>:ref:refs/tags/v*` for version tags (use `StringLike` for this one only)
+
+Do not use `repo:<owner>/<repo>:*`, which would trust pull requests and every branch. Also require
+`aud` = `sts.amazonaws.com`.
+
+## Notifications
+
+Slack notifications use the `SLACK_WEBHOOK` secret.
